OK — every one of the 35 mutants was caught, but 2 of them were
caught with NO killer reaching an assertion: every failing test threw instead.
That is a weaker result and not a failure — a fall-through past a guard whose whole
job was to reject unusable state often cannot reach an answer at all. Read each one
and decide whether a test should pin the DENIAL rather than merely provoke it:
  - Denial.UNKNOWN_MANDATE (line 817)  (TypeError)
  - Denial.CREDENTIAL_MISSING (line 943)  (TypeError)
   exit: 0

